 {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le01ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le01ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm glad I had the foresight to put some money away. These renovations are eating a hole in my wallet!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Tell me about it! First I had a leaky roof, then there was the flood and now I need to get someone to rip up the floors and replace them! I can't even keep track of the money I'm spending. In fact, I'd better have my accountant look at everything including my investments.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  At least you are staying at the Peter hotel rather than paying an exorbitant amount somewhere else!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's true. Thanks for putting us up like this.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's heartwarming when you can get your friends to help you, right Peter?"}, {"time": "35000", "image": "engenn9le01ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yup, and that's why I'm getting you both to help me clean this apartment. It's pretty untidy with the three of us here ... speaking of which, how long do you guys think you are likely to stay?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think it'll be one week more for me. Sally?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ummm. Two. Maybe three.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Okay ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I have an idea. While I stay with you why don't I get a cleaning service to come and clean for us once a week?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Could we have the windows washed?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure!"}, {"time": "67000", "image": "engenn9le01ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: How about we get them to dust and sweep and mop all the floors?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course! That's what they're hired to do.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Would it be asking too much to have someone reorganize the kitchen cupboards?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think that is where I would draw the line. That's not normally what a cleaning service does.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Besides, you are looking at the queen of organization!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}